  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat the oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Finely chop the brown onion. Cut the zucchini into 2cm chunks. Finely chop the garlic.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6004fa9c3ae1a23d5e457834/step-a4721bb7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat 1/2 the butter and\n• a drizzle of olive oil over a medium-high heat. Add the onion and sliced mushrooms and cook, stirring, until tender, 5-6 minutes. Add the garlic, garlic & herb seasoning and arborio rice and cook, stirring, until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6004fa9c3ae1a23d5e457834/step-f22a2cc8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add the water, zucchini and the crumbled vegetable stock to the frying pan and bring to the boil. Transfer the risotto to a baking dish. Cover tightly with foil and bake until the liquid is absorbed and the rice is ‘al dente’, 24-28 minutes.\n• TIP: ‘Al dente’ pasta is cooked through but still slightly firm in the centre.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6004fa9c3ae1a23d5e457834/step-50716d70.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the risotto is baking, finely chop the parsley and pecan nuts. In a medium bowl, combine the balsamic vinegar, honey and a small drizzle of olive oil. Season with salt and pepper. Thinly slice the pear (see ingredients). Add 1/2 the baby spinach leaves and pear to the dressing and toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6004fa9c3ae1a23d5e457834/step-8dbc0e70.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the risotto is done, stir through the grated Parmesan cheese, remaining butter and remaining spinach, until the spinach has wilted. Stir through a splash of water if the risotto looks dry. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6004fa9c3ae1a23d5e457834/step-39951d3f.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drizzle some of the truffle oil over the risotto, to taste. Divide the risotto between bowls and serve with the pear salad. Sprinkle the risotto with the parsley and pecans.\n• TIP: Truffle has a strong flavour, if you're not a fan, serve the risotto without it.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6004fa9c3ae1a23d5e457834/step-ca739009.jpg"
    }
  ]
